{"path":"/zh/concepts/one-diagram-unit-of-work/","title":"单图事务：一次提交一个可验证建模增量","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-70c332ee7562064b-1","revision":"70c332ee7562064b73f5a414c0003200b9b32a05b3b5bf4cb5127d1921bbabcd","tag":"p","quote":"“完成闸机系统模型”可能涉及需求图、用例图、块定义图、内部块图和状态图。这个目标没有稳定的单次完成定义，前一张图的偏差还会继续传到后一张图。"},{"block_id":"adps-b59f82f2502283b0-1","revision":"b59f82f2502283b0f86ee7af0a134b785b7ecd9a6d75a9671dd943eaae1e20b6","tag":"p","quote":"单图事务把一种图、一个已解析挂载位置、一次写入和一份验收回执组成一个 Unit of Work。"},{"block_id":"adps-4a2a241cd50c0320-1","revision":"4a2a241cd50c032038a894be9cf916e8000debdd807d25bf6b20ce6e75b003ec","tag":"pre","quote":"一次用户操作 = 一种图类型 + 一个 scope_ref + 一个 WriteSet + 一份回执"},{"block_id":"adps-f07b8071d7e58f32-1","revision":"f07b8071d7e58f32dde6cb40187fd9614153d5925a2670822021058208352161","tag":"p","quote":"该边界限定本轮允许修改的工程范围、写回前的不变量、实际变更统计和撤销所需的完整变更集。更大的目标由多个可验收事务逐步完成。"},{"block_id":"adps-c7b21f0c6e6a7cf3-1","revision":"c7b21f0c6e6a7cf3f8f77b134206032d6c5a71442a2d16d9350c4383df4a9bb2","tag":"p","quote":"单图事务不保证跨图一致性。上层计划仍需管理多张图之间的依赖、版本和验收顺序。宿主工具缺少原子事务时，适配器需要前态快照、补偿步骤和明确的部分失败状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-f3bb9636596650db-1","revision":"f3bb9636596650dbc19ce94457f1b7c9346406918b15406d64a8584f6b9f8f94","tag":"li","quote":"初始研究来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目，作者袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）；名称由 ADPS 归纳。"},{"block_id":"adps-d6b16fa248572db4-1","revision":"d6b16fa248572db4b168dc14ff786cafc70c526ac3dce910a9186f3e0ffa87f8","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：Unit of Work、Command、transaction boundary。"},{"block_id":"adps-8e54f41963ca7ce9-1","revision":"8e54f41963ca7ce9cd8b3b2f3de95bf5296ef8a36f0291a2847eb79c83824c94","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：把图类型、工程范围、候选结构、回执和撤销合成 Agent 写回边界。"},{"block_id":"adps-57bdf3334b75f2ef-1","revision":"57bdf3334b75f2ef23888a7d5d0622304cccd438037a66a30998c1d3f2297788","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目；作者：袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
